          "markdown": "Title: Monetary policy statements\n\nURL Source: https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/press_conference/monetary-policy-statement/html/index.en.html\n\nMarkdown Content:\n```markdown\n# Monetary policy statements\n\nThe Governing Council takes its monetary policy decision every six weeks. Immediately after the meeting, the President and the Vice President of the ECB explain the decision at the press conference and answer questions from journalists. The press conference can be watched live at 14:45 CET and on demand shortly after.\n\n[Monetary policy decisions](/press/govcdec/mopo/html/index.en.html)\n[Monetary policy accounts](/press/accounts/html/index.en.html)\n[MOST recent press conference](/press/press_conference/html/index.en.html)\n\n## Latest Statements\n\n### 30 April 2026\n- **Christine Lagarde, Luis de Guindos:** [Monetary policy statement (with Q&A)](/press/press_conference/monetary-policy-statement/2026/html/ecb.is260430~f99cb123a8.en.html)\n  - Christine Lagarde, President of the ECB, Luis de Guindos, Vice-President of the ECB, Frankfurt am Main, 30 April 2026\n  - [English](/press/press_conference/monetary-policy-statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~1c397fa90c.en.pdf?642bc8f35891790a8ca9da434d78f0e4)\n  - OTHER LANGUAGES +\n    - [Български BG](/press/press_conference/monetary-policy-statement/2026/html/ecb.is260430~f99cb123a8.bg.html)\n    - [Čeština CS](/press/press_conference/monetary-policy-statement/2026/html/ecb.is260430~f99cb123a8.cs.html)\n    - [Dansk DA](/press/press_conference/monetary-policy-statement/2026/html/ecb.is260430~f99cb123a8.da.html)\n    - [Deutsch DE](/press/pressure/conference/Monetary-Policy-Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.de.html)\n    - [Eλληνικά EL](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.el.html)\n    - [Español ES](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.es.html)\n    - [Eesti keel ET](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.et.html)\n    - [Suomi FI](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.fi.html)\n    - [Français FR](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.fr.html)\n    - [Gaeilge GA](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.ga.html)\n    - [Hrvatski HR](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.hr.html)\n    - [Magyar HU](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb123a8.hu.html)\n    - [Italiano IT](/press/Monetary-Policy/Statement/shared/pdf/ecb.ds260430~f99cb1siquo%7C%7Ce%7C%7C&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=GOV_COP_Web_en&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwzZyOBhBEEiwAGQYnJkRmXWpLrFtYqgqPvMhZlOzQsIiNkTmGxuJiXo5xWpLrFtYqg",
